  (descr "ElectroCookie solderable breadboard, full size, 89 x 52 mm, 30 columns, each with a 5-hole strip F-J (upper half) and a 5-hole strip A-E (lower half), four full-length power rails, two 2-hole pads beside the M3 holes, two M3 and four M2 mounting holes. Holes and strips are on F.Fab only, so parts can sit on them; hole positions come from owner photos and are approximate, mounting holes are measured")
